    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_0" data-source="" data-orig="Refund and Returns Policy for DinWeys Co.">Refund and Returns Policy for DinWeys Co.</span>, Ltd.</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Data Efetiva: [<span class ="tr_" id="tr_1" data-source="" data-orig="Insert Date">Insert Date</span>]</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_2" data-source="" data-orig="At DinWeys Co.">At DinWeys Co.</span>, Ltd., <span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="we strive to ensure customer satisfaction with our products and services">we strive to ensure customer satisfaction with our products and services</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="This Refund and Returns Policy outlines the conditions under which returns">This Refund and Returns Policy outlines the conditions under which returns</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="refunds">refunds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="and exchanges are provided">and exchanges are provided</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="By making a purchase on">By making a purchase on</span> <a href="https://www.dinweys.com">https://www.dinweys.com</a>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="you agree to the terms set out in this policy">you agree to the terms set out in this policy</span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="Returns Eligibility">Returns Eligibility</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="To be eligible for a return">To be eligible for a return</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="your item must meet the following criteria">your item must meet the following criteria</span>:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="The item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it">The item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="The item must be in its original packaging">The item must be in its original packaging</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="You must provide proof of purchase">You must provide proof of purchase</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="such as an order confirmation or receipt">such as an order confirmation or receipt</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Return requests must be made within">Return requests must be made within</span> [<span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="insert timeframe">insert timeframe</span>, Por exemplo, 30 dias] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="from the date of delivery">from the date of delivery</span>.</li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="Non-Returnable Items">Non-Returnable Items</span></strong></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Certain types of goods are exempt from being returned">Certain types of goods are exempt from being returned</span>, incluindo, mas não limitado a:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="Perishable goods">Perishable goods</span> (Por exemplo, comida, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="flowers">flowers</span>)</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Custom or personalized items">Custom or personalized items</span></li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="Downloadable software or digital products">Downloadable software or digital products</span></li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="Gift cards">Gift cards</span></li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Hazardous materials or flammable liquids">Hazardous materials or flammable liquids</span></li></ul><h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Return Process">Return Process</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="To initiate a return">To initiate a return</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="please follow these steps">please follow these steps</span>:</p><ol class="wp-block-list"><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Contact our customer service team at martin@dinweys.com to request a return authorization">Contact our customer service team at <a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a> to request a return authorization</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="Once your return is approved">Once your return is approved</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="you will receive instructions on how and where to send the item">you will receive instructions on how and where to send the item</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="Customers are responsible for paying return shipping costs unless the return is due to a defect or an error on our part">Customers are responsible for paying return shipping costs unless the return is due to a defect or an error on our part</span>.</li></ol><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="Please do not send the item back without receiving authorization from our team">Please do not send the item back without receiving authorization from our team</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="as it may result in delays in processing your return">as it may result in delays in processing your return</span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Refunds">Refunds</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="Once we receive your returned item">Once we receive your returned item</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="we will inspect it and notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund">we will inspect it and notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="If approved">If approved</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="your refund will be processed within">your refund will be processed within</span> 14 dias, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="and a credit will automatically be applied to your original method of payment">and a credit will automatically be applied to your original method of payment</span>.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="Partial Refunds">Partial Refunds</span></strong></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="In some cases">In some cases</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="only partial refunds may be granted">only partial refunds may be granted</span>, como:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Items that are not in their original condition">Items that are not in their original condition</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="damaged">damaged</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="or missing parts for reasons not due to our error">or missing parts for reasons not due to our error</span>.</li><li><span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="Returns initiated after the 30-day return period has expired">Returns initiated after the 30-day return period has expired</span>.</li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="Late or Missing Refunds">Late or Missing Refunds</span></strong></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="If you haven’t received a refund after the stated processing period">If you haven’t received a refund after the stated processing period</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="please check your bank account or credit card statement again">please check your bank account or credit card statement again</span>. Então, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="contact your credit card company or bank">contact your credit card company or bank</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="as it may take some time before the refund is posted">as it may take some time before the refund is posted</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="If you still have not received your refund">If you still have not received your refund</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="please contact us at martin@dinweys.com">please contact us at <a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Exchanges">Exchanges</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="We will replace items if they are defective or damaged">We will replace items if they are defective or damaged</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="If you need to exchange a product for the same item">If you need to exchange a product for the same item</span>, entre em contato conosco em [<span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="insert contact email or phone number">insert contact email or phone number</span>] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="and follow the instructions provided by our customer service team">and follow the instructions provided by our customer service team</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Exchange requests must be made within">Exchange requests must be made within</span> [<span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="insert timeframe">insert timeframe</span>, Por exemplo, 30 dias] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="of receiving the item">of receiving the item</span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="Shipping Costs for Returns">Shipping Costs for Returns</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Unless the return is due to a defect or our error">Unless the return is due to a defect or our error</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="the customer is responsible for covering return shipping costs">the customer is responsible for covering return shipping costs</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="We recommend using a trackable shipping service or purchasing shipping insurance">We recommend using a trackable shipping service or purchasing shipping insurance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="as we cannot guarantee that we will receive your returned item">as we cannot guarantee that we will receive your returned item</span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Cancellations">Cancellations</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="You may cancel your order for a full refund if it has not yet been shipped">You may cancel your order for a full refund if it has not yet been shipped</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Once the order has been shipped">Once the order has been shipped</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="it will be subject to the return policy outlined above">it will be subject to the return policy outlined above</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Please contact our customer service team immediately to cancel an order">Please contact our customer service team immediately to cancel an order</span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. <strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Damaged or Incorrect Items">Damaged or Incorrect Items</span></strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="If you receive a damaged or incorrect item">If you receive a damaged or incorrect item</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="please contact us within">please contact us within</span> [<span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="insert timeframe">insert timeframe</span>, Por exemplo, 7 dias] <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="of receiving the product">of receiving the product</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="We will provide instructions for returning the item and arrange a replacement or refund at no additional cost to you">We will provide instructions for returning the item and arrange a replacement or refund at no additional cost to you</span>.</p><h2 class="wp-block-heading">8. <strong>Contate-nos</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="If you have any questions about our Refund and Returns Policy">If you have any questions about our Refund and Returns Policy</span>, entre em contato conosco em:</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>DinWeys Co., Ltd.</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>ADICIONAR: #3 construindo o Norte do Vale do Silício, Distrito de Qiaodong, Cidade de Zhangjiakou, Hebei, China</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Telefone: +86 13323237275</strong></p>`} />
